------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
PRICING AN EXTRA GATE ON THE EXCLUSIVE-SUPPORT PATH 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
gate                                 pairs    %kept top-2 hit 
as shipped                          29,238     100%      1370 
+ require a shared token            20,219      69%      1353 
+ require same city                 12,824      44%      1327 
+ shared token OR same city         24,359      83%      1370 
+ shared token AND same city         8,684      30%      1310 
 
The `as shipped` row is the one to beat. A gate that removes a third of 
the table but only a handful of firing edges is buying nothing measurable 
on this evidence - and it would remove the acronym and rebrand cases that 
are the only reason disclosure beats a name rule at all. 
